# Emacs mode editing commands.  Every case runs readline once (preamble
# script) and dumps the line state with <dump> between keys.
tags: emacs editing
--- script
readline "> "

=== self-insert-and-accept
keys: hello world\r

=== motion-char-and-line
--- keys
abcdef\C-a<dump>\C-f\C-f<dump>\C-e<dump>\C-b<dump>\r

=== motion-word
--- keys
one two three\M-b<dump>\M-b<dump>\M-f<dump>\C-a\M-f<dump>\r

=== kill-line-and-yank
tags: kill
--- keys
hello world\C-a\M-f\C-k<dump>\C-a\C-y<dump>\r

=== kill-word-and-yank-pop
tags: kill
--- keys
aaa bbb ccc\C-a\M-d\M-d<dump>\C-e \C-y<dump>\M-y<dump>\r

=== backward-kill-word-and-unix-discard
tags: kill
--- keys
foo bar/baz\C-w<dump>\M-\C-?<dump>\C-u<dump>\C-y\r

=== delete-and-rubout
--- keys
abcdef\C-a\C-d<dump>\C-e\C-?<dump>\C-b<bs><dump>\r

=== transpose
--- keys
abcd\C-t<dump>\C-a\C-t<dump>one two\M-t<dump>\r

=== case-words
--- keys
hello big world\C-a\M-u<dump>\M-l<dump>\M-c<dump>\r

=== numeric-argument
tags: numarg
--- keys
abcdefgh\C-a\M-3\C-f<dump>\M--\M-2\C-f<dump>\C-u\C-f<dump>\M-4x<dump>\r

=== multi-digit-argument
tags: numarg
--- keys
\M-1\M-2x<dump>\M-1\M-0\C-b<dump>\r

=== undo
tags: undo
--- keys
abc def\C-w<dump>\C-_<dump>\C-x\C-u<dump>\C-_\C-_<dumpfull>\r

=== revert-line
tags: undo
--- keys
abc\M-r<dump>xyz\r

=== mark-and-region
tags: kill
--- keys
hello world\C-a\C-@\M-f<dump>\C-w<dump>\C-x\C-x<dump>\r

=== quoted-insert
--- keys
a\C-q\C-ab\C-v\tc<dump>\r

=== tab-insert-and-comment
--- keys
x\M-\t<dump>\M-#

=== clear-screen
--- keys
first\C-l<snap>second\r

=== history-navigation
tags: history
--- script
readline "> " 4 addhist
--- keys
one\rtwo\r\C-p<dump>\C-p<dump>\C-p<dump>\C-n<dump>\M-<<dump>\M-><dump>\r\C-pX\r

=== reverse-isearch
tags: isearch history
--- script
readline "> " 4 addhist
--- keys
make all\rgit status\rmake test\r\C-rmak<snap>\C-r<snap><dump>\C-j\r

=== isearch-abort
tags: isearch history
--- script
readline "> " 2 addhist
--- keys
alpha\rbe\C-ral<pause>\C-g<dump>ta\r

=== keyboard-macro
tags: macro
--- keys
\C-x(ab\C-x)\C-xe\C-xe<dump>\r

=== eof-on-empty-line
--- script
readline "> " 3
--- keys
abc\C-d<dump>\C-a\C-d<dump>\r\C-d
